l: Heat-Shock Transformation of E. coli > Troubleshooting", "attrs": {}, "unit": "u9", "text": "| Lawn of bacteria | Antibiotic degraded | Use plates younger than 4 weeks |\n", "tokens": [91, 69492, 315, 24032, 765, 95951, 62114, 91978, 765, 5560, 25485, 14992, 1109, 220, 19, 5672, 9432], "positions": [170, 171, 172, 173, 174, 175, 176, 177, 178, 179, 180, 181, 182, 183, 184, 185, 186], "seq_ids": [6], "token_class": "MCCCMCCCMCCCCWCCM"}, {"id": "n38", "node_type": "table_row", "parent": "n33", "children": [], "depth": 4, "title": "", "path": "Protocol: Heat-Shock Transformation of E. coli > Troubleshooting", "attrs": {}, "unit": "u9", "text": "| Colonies on negative control | Contaminated cells | Use a fresh aliquot |\n\n", "tokens": [91, 32042, 552, 389, 8389, 2585, 765, 2140, 8778, 660, 7917, 765, 5560, 264, 7878, 43391, 354, 36821], "positions": [187, 188, 189, 190, 191, 192, 193, 194, 195, 196, 197, 198, 199, 200, 201, 202, 203, 204], "seq_ids": [6], "token_class": "MCCCCCMCCCCMCCCCCM"}, {"id": "n39", "node_type": "heading", "parent": "n1", "children": ["n40"], "depth": 2, "title": "Record keeping", "path": "Protocol: Heat-Shock Transformation of E. coli > Record keeping", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "unit": "u1", "text": "## Record keeping\n\n", "tokens": [567, 13896, 10494, 271], "positions": [80, 81, 82, 83], "seq_ids": [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6], "token_class": "MCCW"}, {"id": "n40", "node_type": "paragraph", "parent": "n39", "children": [], "depth": 3, "title": "", "path": "Protocol: Heat-Shock Transformation of E. coli > Record keeping", "attrs": {}, "unit": "u1", "text": "Write the date, plasmid name, cell batch number and colony count in the shared lab\nnotebook. Photograph each plate before it is discarded.\n", "tokens": [8144, 279, 2457, 11, 628, 10753, 307, 836, 11, 2849, 7309, 1396, 323, 42036, 1797, 304, 279, 6222, 10278, 198, 10179, 2239, 13, 33255, 1855, 12235, 1603, 433, 374, 44310, 627], "positions": [84, 85, 86, 87, 88, 89, 90, 91, 92, 93, 94, 95, 96, 9